    "text": "A vector parallel to the line of intersection is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></math><br />for a point on the line of intersection<br />Put <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, equation line to the intersection is<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> line of intersection is parallel to the plane <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
